ion concludes that no concrete tool set can be identified\n  from the available feedback, that conclusion is recorded with the evidence\n  gap stated, so the requirement can be returned to refinement.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- **HLR-3** (The platform should integrate better with existing enterprise\n  tooling; no specific tools were named in the consolidated feedback) — this\n  epic converts the unnamed requirement into named, prioritized targets.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":38654,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-825e6e96b89ca063","agent_id":"a2ce99d6c8d9661f6","session_id":"8ed8530c-ec7e-4422-9e2a-22ede41c26ec","uuid":"c6d9b704-18bd-4925-8d82-682c99f9f50a","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:43:03.488Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9008"}
