{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9c2f17be3cbf7d23","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9008-E002\n3\ttitle: Define data-scientist onboarding scope and locate where the onboarding day\n4\t  is spent\n5\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9008\n6\tcomponent: Dashboard\n7\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n8\ttype: Investigation\n9\tpriority: P1\n10\tinvestigation_signals:\n11\t  question_specificity: 1\n12\t  source_accessibility: 0\n13\t  local_runnability: 0\n14\t  cluster_hardware_dependence: -1\n15\t  human_judgment_required: -1\n16\timplementation_type: null\n17\tdependencies: []\n18\tai_signals: null\n19\tai_implementability: Low\n20\tai_implementability_score: -1\n21\tjira_key: null\n22\tbranch: null\n23\tgated_by: null\n24\tgate_failure_impact: null\n25\t---\n26\t# Define data-scientist onboarding scope and locate where the onboarding day is spent\n27\t\n28\t## Description\n29\t\n30\tThe strategy requires that onboarding a new data scientist take \"less than a\n31\tday\", but neither what onboarding covers nor where the day is currently spent\n32\tis defined. This investigation defines the onboarding scope (which of cluster\n33\taccess, project setup, first workbench, first deployed model — or other stages\n34\tdiscovered during the study — are in bounds) and produces a time breakdown of\n35\tthe current journey, so the onboarding-improvement work targets the actual\n36\tcost centers instead of a guess.\n37\t\n38\t## Scope\n39\t\n40\t- Enumerate the candidate onboarding stages from account access to first\n41\t  productive work (cluster access, project setup, first workbench, first\n42\t  deployed model, plus any additional stages the study surfaces).\n43\t- Define which stages the \"less than a day\" target covers, with an explicit\n44\t  boundary and rationale, and get that definition accepted by product\n45\t  management.\n46\t- Measure or estimate current elapsed time per stage, using available\n47\t  evidence: deployment telemetry, support tickets, field/account reports, and\n48\t  direct observation of representative new-user sessions.\n49\t- Produce a ranked list of time cost centers identifying where the day is\n50\t  actually lost.\n51\t- Recommend which stage(s) the onboarding-time reduction work should target,\n52\t  with expected time savings per stage.\n53\t\n54\t## Acceptance Criteria\n55\t\n56\t- An onboarding definition exists that states the included stages and the\n57\t  explicit out-of-bounds boundary, accepted by product management.\n58\t- A per-stage time breakdown exists, with the evidence source cited for each\n59\t  stage's figure.\n60\t- A ranked cost-center list identifies the dominant time consumers in the\n61\t  defined onboarding scope.\n62\t- A recommendation names the stage(s) to target for the under-a-day goal and\n63\t  estimates the time recoverable from each.\n64\t\n65\t## HLR Traceability\n66\t\n67\t- **HLR-2** (Onboarding a new data scientist should take less than a day; it\n68\t  is not defined what onboarding includes or where the day is currently spent)\n69\t  — this epic supplies the missing definition and diagnosis that the\n70\t  implementation depends on.\n71\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a65da344f1754f2a","agent_id":"a2f6433638117d63b","session_id":"8ed8530c-ec7e-4422-9e2a-22ede41c26ec","uuid":"a3497c72-0645-45de-9dec-c43a1f8a2c85","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:46:53.699Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9c2f17be3cbf7d23","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9008 decomposition"}
