{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b263c84be9385bdc","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9008-E003\n3\ttitle: Identify the enterprise tools meant by the integration feedback\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9008\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Investigation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tinvestigation_signals:\n10\t  question_specificity: 1\n11\t  source_accessibility: 0\n12\t  local_runnability: 0\n13\t  cluster_hardware_dependence: 0\n14\t  human_judgment_required: -1\n15\timplementation_type: null\n16\tdependencies: []\n17\tai_signals: null\n18\tai_implementability: Low\n19\tai_implementability_score: 0\n20\tjira_key: null\n21\tbranch: null\n22\tgated_by: null\n23\tgate_failure_impact: null\n24\t---\n25\t# Identify the enterprise tools meant by the integration feedback\n26\t\n27\t## Description\n28\t\n29\tThe strategy requires the platform to \"integrate better\" with existing\n30\tenterprise tooling, but the consolidated feedback names no specific tools.\n31\tThis investigation determines which tools the feedback actually refers to and\n32\tproduces a prioritized integration target list with an integration-surface\n33\thypothesis per tool, so the integration work builds against named targets\n34\tinstead of an unspecified \"better integration\".\n35\t\n36\t## Scope\n37\t\n38\t- Consolidate the tool-related enterprise feedback from all field channels\n39\t  (account teams, support, filed quotes), coordinating with the parallel\n40\t  feedback-consolidation effort for the admin-configuration question rather\n41\t  than duplicating it.\n42\t- Interview the account and field teams to attach concrete tool names to the\n43\t  vague \"integrate better\" asks.\n44\t- For each candidate tool, record the source feedback, the integration\n45\t  surface where RHOAI would plausibly connect (as visible from the\n46\t  platform's architecture context), and a rough feasibility and impact\n47\t  assessment.\n48\t- Produce a prioritized shortlist of integration targets with rationale,\n49\t  reviewed by product management.\n50\t\n51\t## Acceptance Criteria\n52\t\n53\t- Every candidate tool is named with the feedback or interview that motivated\n54\t  it — no tool enters the list without a traceable source.\n55\t- A prioritized shortlist exists with, per tool, the rationale, a feasibility\n56\t  note, and an integration-surface hypothesis.\n57\t- The shortlist has been reviewed and its ordering accepted by product\n58\t  management.\n59\t- If the investigation concludes that no concrete tool set can be identified\n60\t  from the available feedback, that conclusion is recorded with the evidence\n61\t  gap stated, so the requirement can be returned to refinement.\n62\t\n63\t## HLR Traceability\n64\t\n65\t- **HLR-3** (The platform should integrate better with existing enterprise\n66\t  tooling; no specific tools were named in the consolidated feedback) — this\n67\t  epic converts the unnamed requirement into named, prioritized targets.\n68\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a65da344f1754f2a","agent_id":"a2f6433638117d63b","session_id":"8ed8530c-ec7e-4422-9e2a-22ede41c26ec","uuid":"1ef8aa7a-7168-4db3-ac9a-d247154f9f5a","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:46:57.709Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b263c84be9385bdc","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9008 decomposition"}
