{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-be69747d10a692d1","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9008-E004\n3\ttitle: Deliver the resolved admin-configuration experience\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9008\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9008-E001\n11\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-9008-E001\n12\tgate_failure_impact:\n13\t  action: rewrite\n14\t  fallback_approach: If the precedence decision selects fine-grained per-project controls\n15\t    rather than simplification (or vice versa), the implementation scope is rewritten\n16\t    to the chosen direction; if the decision defers both directions, this epic is\n17\t    removed from the release and the requirement returns to refinement.\n18\tai_signals:\n19\t  change_specificity: -1\n20\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n21\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n22\t  existing_foundation: 1\n23\t  open_questions: -1\n24\t  external_dependency: 0\n25\t  human_process_gates: 0\n26\t  repo_access: 1\n27\t  architecture_claims: 0\n28\timplementation_type: null\n29\tinvestigation_signals: null\n30\tai_implementability: Medium\n31\tai_implementability_score: 1\n32\tjira_key: null\n33\tbranch: null\n34\t---\n35\t# Deliver the resolved admin-configuration experience\n36\t\n37\t## Description\n38\t\n39\tThis epic implements the admin-configuration direction chosen by the\n40\tenterprise-feedback consolidation and precedence decision — reducing exposed\n41\tconfiguration complexity, adding fine-grained per-project controls, or the\n42\thybrid the decision record specifies. The Dashboard is the surface where\n43\tper-component feature flags and defaults are administered, so the\n44\timplementation lands in its configuration and settings surfaces. The scope\n45\tbelow is deliberately at the functional level of the strategy; the decision\n46\trecord fixes the direction and the implementing team fixes the design.\n