pic's scope is rewritten (or re-assigned to the owning\n48\tcomponent) per its gate outcome.\n49\t\n50\t## Scope\n51\t\n52\t- Implement improvements to the stage(s) the onboarding study identified as\n53\t  the dominant time cost centers, within the workbench experience (workbench\n54\t  spawn and startup, image pulling and availability, first-use\n55\t  configuration).\n56\t- Meet the \"under a day\" target for the onboarding scope as defined and\n57\t  accepted in that study.\n58\t- Include any incidental documentation touch-ups for changed behavior (no\n59\t  new standalone content).\n60\t\n61\t## Acceptance Criteria\n62\t\n63\t- A run-through of the defined onboarding scope by a representative new data\n64\t  scientist (or a validated measurement equivalent) completes in under a day.\n65\t- Each implemented improvement maps to a cost center named in the onboarding\n66\t  study's ranked list — no speculative improvements outside the identified\n67\t  cost centers.\n68\t- Changed workbench behavior is covered by regression tests.\n69\t- The workbench components' existing build and test pipeline is green on the\n70\t  delivered change.\n71\t\n72\t## HLR Traceability\n73\t\n74\t- **HLR-2** (Onboarding a new data scientist should take less than a day) —\n75\t  this epic delivers the time reduction once the scope and cost centers are\n76\t  known.\n77\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a65da344f1754f2a","agent_id":"a2f6433638117d63b","session_id":"8ed8530c-ec7e-4422-9e2a-22ede41c26ec","uuid":"77ef9766-d51c-4daf-bdc0-a9e3ab71bc54","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:47:02.536Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-998acc28ba0221d4","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9008 decomposition"}
